WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:02.091
It was lunchtime.

2
00:00:02.092 --> 00:00:05.772
Roxy and her friends were walking to the cafeteria.

3
00:00:05.773 --> 00:00:09.731
"Did you guys hear about Crime Fighter Bot?" Jack said.

4
00:00:09.732 --> 00:00:13.392
"Last week it caught those bank robbers who had bombs."

5
00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:15.578
"Yeah!" Mara said.

6
00:00:15.579 --> 00:00:20.299
"Yesterday it stopped a big monster from stomping on the city."

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.773
Roxy sighed.

8
00:00:21.774 --> 00:00:26.258
"Everybody forgot about Rocket Girl while I was sick," she thought.

9
00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.574
"Big deal," Terrell said.

10
00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:31.950
"Rocket Girl can fly and shoot lasers."

11
00:00:31.951 --> 00:00:35.922
"Rocket Girl can't shoot nets, though," Jack said.

12
00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:38.941
"She doesn't need to shoot nets," Terrell said.

13
00:00:38.942 --> 00:00:42.542
"She can still beat that dumb robot anytime!"

14
00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:45.564
"Where is Rocket Girl?" Mara asked.

15
00:00:45.565 --> 00:00:48.295
"No one has seen her for a while."

16
00:00:48.296 --> 00:00:52.536
"I guess nobody calls her anymore," Roxy said.

17
00:00:52.537 --> 00:00:57.092
Just then Roxy's watch beeped. "Yay!" she thought.

18
00:00:57.093 --> 00:01:00.772
"I, uh, need a drink of water," Roxy said.

19
00:01:00.773 --> 00:01:05.736
She ran over to a drinking fountain.

20
00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:09.498
"Mayor Bloom, what's the emergency?" Roxy asked.

21
00:01:09.499 --> 00:01:12.547
"Hello, Rocket Girl. No emergency.

22
00:01:12.548 --> 00:01:16.077
How are you feeling?" Mayor Bloom said.

23
00:01:16.078 --> 00:01:19.237
"Uh, better, Mayor," Roxy said.

24
00:01:19.238 --> 00:01:21.179
"What are you calling about?"

25
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:26.683
"Detective Smith wants to see you at Police Headquarters," Mayor Bloom said.

26
00:01:26.684 --> 00:01:31.912
"I'll be right there!" Roxy said.

27
00:01:31.913 --> 00:01:35.098
At Police Headquarters everything was quiet.

28
00:01:35.099 --> 00:01:39.794
One officer was snoring at his desk.

29
00:01:39.795 --> 00:01:42.547
"Hey, Detective," Roxy said.

30
00:01:42.548 --> 00:01:45.474
"Did you just take a nap too?

31
00:01:45.475 --> 00:01:46.797
Oh, wait a minute.

32
00:01:46.798 --> 00:01:50.099
Your hair always looks really messy!"

33
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:54.477
Detective Smith laughed.

34
00:01:54.478 --> 00:01:59.012
Roxy blinked in surprise. "You think my joke is funny?"

35
00:01:59.013 --> 00:02:03.114
"Yep!" Detective Smith said. "I've missed you."

36
00:02:03.115 --> 00:02:07.203
"Thanks, Detective!" Roxy grinned. "What's up?"

37
00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:10.005
"We have a problem," Detective Smith said.

38
00:02:10.006 --> 00:02:14.578
"Crime Fighter Bot is out of control. Watch this."

39
00:02:14.579 --> 00:02:16.749
He showed Roxy a video.

40
00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:19.805
A man dropped a banana peel on the sidewalk.

41
00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:23.472
Suddenly Crime Fighter Bot appeared and shot out a net.

42
00:02:23.473 --> 00:02:25.782
The man was trapped in the net.

43
00:02:25.783 --> 00:02:27.550
Detective Smith frowned.

44
00:02:27.551 --> 00:02:30.062
"This robot is causing lots of trouble.

45
00:02:30.063 --> 00:02:34.195
It can't tell what's a serious crime and what's not."

46
00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:37.866
"Did you ask Dr. Odd about it?" Roxy asked.

47
00:02:37.867 --> 00:02:42.707
"Not yet. I—" He looked up, but Roxy was already gone.

48
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:48.347
He smiled. "It's just like old times!"

49
00:02:48.348 --> 00:02:53.279
As Roxy flew over the city, she quickly spotted the robot.

50
00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.909
"What's going on here?" she thought, landing near it.

51
00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:00.271
Some teenagers with skateboards stood in front of a sign.

52
00:03:00.272 --> 00:03:03.721
The sign read "No Skateboards."

53
00:03:03.722 --> 00:03:07.594
Crime Fighter Bot was blaring a loud siren at them.

54
00:03:07.595 --> 00:03:10.361
"That's enough!" Roxy called.

55
00:03:10.362 --> 00:03:13.594
"These are just kids, not criminals."

56
00:03:13.595 --> 00:03:17.499
Crime Fighter Bot spun around, its lights flashing.

57
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:23.788
"You're under arrest!"

